.TH MANANNAN 8 "" "Manannan @PROJECT_VERSION@" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
manannan \- plugin-based dynamic DNS updater
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B manannan
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR config.yaml ]
.RB [ \-\-secrets
.IR secrets.yaml ]
.RB [ \-\- \fIsetting\fR
.IR value ]...
.br
.B manannan migrate
.I manannan.yaml environment config.yaml secrets.yaml
.br
.B manannan \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B manannan
reads a value from a source plugin, typically the host's public IP address,
and reconciles it with every record held by one or more registry plugins,
typically DNS providers. It repeats on the cadence the configuration sets
until it receives SIGINT or SIGTERM. Each record is checked and updated
independently, so a failure in one zone or account does not hold up the
others; a failed record is retried on the next cycle.
.PP
It normally runs as
.BR manannan.service ,
as the
.B manannan
system user.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " file"
The configuration; by default
.IR @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/manannan/config.yaml .
.TP
.BI \-\-secrets " file"
The secrets, merged over the configuration, which must be readable by their
owner only; by default
.I @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/manannan/secrets.yaml
when it exists.
.TP
.BI \-\- setting " value"
Overrides a setting: the dotted path with
.B .
and
.B _
written as
.BR \- ,
so
.B log.level
is
.BR \-\-log\-level .
Also written
.BI \-\- setting = value\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B migrate
Convert a 0.3 installation's
.I manannan.yaml
and environment file into
.I config.yaml
and
.I secrets.yaml
(mode 0600).
.SH CONFIGURATION
The
.B manannan
block sets
.B cadence
(an integer and one of ms, s, m or h),
.B source
(one source plugin),
.B registries
(a list of registry plugins) and
.B plugin_directories
(directories scanned for plugins). The
.B log
block sets
.B level
(all, debug, info, warn or error) and
.B format
(text or json). Each plugin reads its own block at
.BI source. name
or
.BI registry. name\fR.
A value written as
.BI ${ NAME }
is read from the environment variable
.IR NAME .
.PP
The bundled plugins are
.B amazon_check_ip
and
.BR aws_route53 .
Their settings are described in docs/configuration.md at
https://github.com/tomdionysus/manannan.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.BI MANANNAN_ SETTING
Overrides a setting when set and not empty: the dotted path in capitals with
.B .
written as
.BR _ ,
so
.B log.level
is
.BR MANANNAN_LOG_LEVEL .
A flag overrides the environment.
.TP
.BR AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID ", " AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY ", " AWS_SESSION_TOKEN
The credentials
.B aws_route53
uses for anything its base credentials leave empty.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/manannan/config.yaml
The configuration. It holds no secrets.
.TP
.I @CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_SYSCONFDIR@/manannan/secrets.yaml
Keys, readable by the service's user only.
.TP
.I @MANANNAN_PLUGIN_DIR@
The bundled plugins.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 after a clean shutdown or a migration, 1 when the configuration, a plugin or
a migration is refused, 2 on a usage error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR journalctl (1)
